# Packaging output, never source. `switchyard-request-publication` and the
# trusted bootstrap both write a bundle into the worktree they were run from,
# and a bundle swept into a commit by `git add -A` is then carried by every
# later handoff bundle and exported into the root-owned installed release
# (SYRD-100 review).
/.switchyard-bootstrap-*.bundle
